[{"id":"CN-TR-014","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","MSS","MTU","抓包"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":14,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>在 TCP 抓包中，如何用 MSS 与路径反馈定位大包黑洞？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先比较两端 SYN/SYN-ACK 的 MSS，再观察实际 TCP 载荷、IP 包大小，以及是否出现 ICMP Packet Too Big 或需要分片反馈。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>这张卡关注传输层证据链：MSS 是端点在握手中表达的 TCP 载荷上限，MTU 是路径/链路约束，PMTUD 依赖路径反馈。没有反馈时还要考虑 ICMP 过滤、隧道开销和中间设备策略；先分别判断这三个概念，再把它们放回抓包字段和路径反馈中。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>抓包时把握手协商和实际载荷分开记录：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>观察位置\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>记录内容\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>用途\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SYN/SYN-ACK\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>MSS\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>端点表达的 TCP 载荷上限\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>数据段\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>实际长度与重传\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>是否按预期发送\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>ICMP/路径\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>Packet Too Big 等反馈\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>PMTUD 是否有证据\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a11-array","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["Bash","数组"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化","articlePath":"posts/496664b1/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化","articlePath":"posts/496664b1/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Indexed arrays 和 Associative arrays 何时使用？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>整数顺序索引用 Indexed arrays，字符串键查值用 Associative arrays。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>两种数组分别按数字索引和字符串键访问：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">files=(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;two words&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;*.log&#x27;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">declare\u003c/span> -A count=([ok]=2 [failed]=1)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;first=&lt;%s&gt;\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$&#123;files[0]&#125;\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;ok=%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$&#123;count[ok]&#125;\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">for\u003c/span> file \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">in\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$&#123;files[@]&#125;\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>; \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">do\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;file=&lt;%s&gt;\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$file\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>; \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">done\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>Indexed array\u003c/code> 适合保留顺序的参数，\u003ccode>Associative array\u003c/code> 适合按名称累计状态。始终用带引号的数组展开保留元素边界；把数组拼成空格分隔字符串会丢失空格、通配符和空元素。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-context-isolation","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["BrowserContext","测试隔离"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(七)浏览器上下文.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(七)浏览器上下文","articlePath":"posts/8dafa0dc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(七)浏览器上下文.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(七)浏览器上下文","articlePath":"posts/8dafa0dc/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/8141684d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>BrowserContext 隔离是否等于测试数据隔离？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不等于，它只负责浏览器端会话隔离。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>数据库记录、缓存、消息队列和第三方沙箱仍可能共享。测试必须使用唯一数据标识，并由创建数据的 Fixture 负责清理。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>BrowserContext 隔离的是浏览器会话，不是整个系统：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>状态\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>Context 能隔离吗\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>仍需处理什么\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Cookie、localStorage、页面缓存\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>通常可以\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>storage_state 是否按角色生成\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>数据库订单\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不能\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>唯一数据标识与清理\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>消息队列、第三方沙箱\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不能自动\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>namespace、租户或专用环境\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>因此 Fixture 既要创建独立 Context，也要负责服务端数据的生命周期。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-install-layers","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["安装","环境"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(二)快速开始.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(二)快速开始","articlePath":"posts/da4e7889/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(二)快速开始.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(二)快速开始","articlePath":"posts/da4e7889/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么安装 \u003ccode>pytest-playwright\u003c/code> 后还要运行 \u003ccode>playwright install\u003c/code>？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>前者安装 Python 包，后者下载匹配的浏览器二进制。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Playwright 客户端、浏览器二进制和 Linux 系统依赖是三层资源。只完成其中一层，测试仍可能在启动浏览器时失败。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>安装失败时先按资源层定位，而不是反复重装同一个包：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>层\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>提供什么\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>典型验证\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Python 包\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>pytest 插件与 Python API\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>uv run python -c “import playwright”\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>浏览器二进制\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>Chromium/Firefox/WebKit 可执行文件\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>playwright install 后启动\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>系统依赖\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>Linux 图形、字体和运行库\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>镜像或 install-deps 检查\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>三层中任何一层缺失，错误都会在启动阶段出现；包版本正确并不能证明浏览器和系统依赖已经就绪。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-drag-choice","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["拖拽","鼠标"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(五)页面交互操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(五)页面交互操作","articlePath":"posts/fdf6b990/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(五)页面交互操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(五)页面交互操作","articlePath":"posts/fdf6b990/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>标准拖拽组件首先应尝试哪种方式？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>A\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>高层 \u003ccode>drag_to()\u003c/code> 更接近用户行为并保留 Playwright 的定位与可操作性检查；仅在组件需要特殊指针轨迹时降级到底层鼠标操作。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>先使用高层动作表达用户意图：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">source.drag_to(target)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>只有组件依赖特殊轨迹、按压时长或中间事件时，才降到底层 mouse.move、down、up。固定坐标和直接改 DOM 会绕过定位、可操作性和真实交互边界。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["A"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>source.drag_to(target)\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>固定屏幕绝对坐标\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>直接修改目标 DOM\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"playwright-wait-boundary","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["自动等待","断言"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(四)断言与等待.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(四)断言与等待","articlePath":"posts/70bae600/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(四)断言与等待.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(四)断言与等待","articlePath":"posts/70bae600/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 \u003ccode>click()\u003c/code> 成功后仍然需要断言？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>自动等待只保证动作可执行，不保证业务结果正确。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>点击会等待元素可操作并发送输入事件；成功提示、URL、订单状态或后端数据属于动作后的业务结果，需要单独使用 Web-first 断言或 API 核验。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>动作和结果是两次不同的断言：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">page.get_by_role(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;button&quot;\u003c/span>, name=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;提交&quot;\u003c/span>).click()  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 只证明动作可执行\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">expect(page.get_by_role(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;status&quot;\u003c/span>)).to_have_text(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;已提交&quot;\u003c/span>)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 才证明业务结果\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>自动等待会检查元素是否可操作，但不会替业务判断成功；结果应使用 Web-first 断言或 API 证据继续确认。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-delivery-evidence","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["交付证据"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十三)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十三)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/b428e868/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十三)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十三)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/b428e868/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>什么证据才能说明测试套件可交付？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>结果、收集范围、退出码、失败诊断、资源清理、并行稳定性、报告可解析性和产物安全共同通过。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>“绿色”只是一个结果，不是完整交付证据。最小证据包应能回答：运行了什么、用什么环境、失败如何定位、产物是否安全。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>证据\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>用途\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Node ID、收集数量、退出码\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>证明范围和结果\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Python/Pytest 版本、配置摘要\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>解释环境差异\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>串行/并行对照与首次回溯\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>发现隔离或 flaky 问题\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>覆盖率口径、JUnit/Allure 检查\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>说明报告含义和安全边界\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>外部服务、平台差异和未执行场景要明确列出；不要把一次本地绿灯写成所有环境都已验证。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-05-users-without-orders-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["LEFT JOIN","NOT EXISTS","反连接"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询","articlePath":"posts/55ce38b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询","articlePath":"posts/55ce38b/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>查询从未下过订单的用户，要求每个用户只返回一次。SQL 应该怎么写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> u.id, u.email\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> users \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> u\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">EXISTS\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> o \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> o.user_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> u.id)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> u.id;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>NOT EXISTS\u003c/code> 对每个用户做一个布尔判断：找到一条订单就排除，找不到才保留。它不会把订单行拼到结果中，因此用户有多笔订单也只返回一次。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">users\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  ├─ user 1 → 找到订单 → false\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  ├─ user 2 → 找到订单 → false\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  └─ user 3 → 没有订单 → true\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>LEFT JOIN\u003c/code> 也能实现，但订单条件必须放在 \u003ccode>ON\u003c/code>，并用 \u003ccode>o.id IS NULL\u003c/code> 判断右侧没有匹配；把条件放进 \u003ccode>WHERE\u003c/code> 会把外连接意外变成内连接。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-date-range","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","日期","区间"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(七)输入域与边界测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(七)输入域与边界测试","articlePath":"posts/69145da7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(七)输入域与边界测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(七)输入域与边界测试","articlePath":"posts/69145da7/"}],"articleIndex":10,"articleCount":14,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>开始日期和结束日期如何设计功能测试？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>分别覆盖合法日历日期和区间关系，再检查同日、30/31/32 天、跨月、闰日、反向输入及时间区的展示与提交。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>假设：开始日不晚于结束日，最多 31 个自然日且首尾都计入；时区固定为 UTC，夏令时另列后续。模型：合法日期等价类 + 30/31/32 天边界 + 跨字段关系。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>用例\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>前置与数据\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>步骤与观察\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>预期\u003c/th>\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\">优先级\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>选择理由\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>DR-01\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>开始/结束均为空\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>选择器保持空→提交→观察提示、请求和草稿\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>提示必填；不发请求；不保存不完整草稿\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>缺失类\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>DR-02\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>开始=结束=\u003ccode>2026-03-15\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>选开始→选结束→提交→观察请求和结果天数\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>接受 1 个自然日；请求保留当天\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>同日关系\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>DR-30\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>开始 \u003ccode>2026-03-01\u003c/code>，结束 \u003ccode>2026-03-30\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>依次选择→提交→观察结果范围/计数\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>接受 30 天闭区间；结果含首尾\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>上界内邻点\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>DR-31\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>开始 \u003ccode>2026-03-01\u003c/code>，结束 \u003ccode>2026-03-31\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>依次选择→提交→观察请求和计数\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>接受 31 天闭区间\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>最大有效边界\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>DR-32\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>开始 \u003ccode>2026-03-01\u003c/code>，结束 \u003ccode>2026-04-01\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>依次选择→提交→观察前端拦截和请求\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>拒绝 32 天；提示范围；不发请求\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>上界右邻点\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>DR-LEAP\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>2024-02-29\u003c/code> 至 \u003ccode>2024-03-01\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>选择日期→提交→观察日历和结果\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>闰日合法；天数计算包含两端\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>闰年合法类\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>DR-INVALID\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>2025-02-29\u003c/code> 或 \u003ccode>2026-02-30\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>输入/选择→提交→观察字段错误\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>拒绝非法日历日期；不发请求\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>日历无效类\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>DR-REVERSE\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>开始 \u003ccode>2026-04-02\u003c/code>，结束 \u003ccode>2026-04-01\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>选择两端→提交→观察关系提示和草稿\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>拒绝反向区间；不保存为有效查询\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>关系约束\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>代表值选择：同日、30/31/32 天覆盖闭区间关系和上限两侧；闰日与月末覆盖日历分区。遗漏与追问：空一端、输入格式、浏览器时区与服务端 UTC、夏令时跨越、切换时区后是否仍按自然日；固定时钟后再比较结果，不能凭本机日期下结论。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a07-concept-1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["等价类","边界值"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(七)输入域与边界测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(七)输入域与边界测试","articlePath":"posts/69145da7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(七)输入域与边界测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(七)输入域与边界测试","articlePath":"posts/69145da7/"}],"articleIndex":12,"articleCount":14,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>等价类和边界值应该如何组合？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先用等价类覆盖每个有效/无效分区，再在有序范围的两侧补边界及最邻近值。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>等价类减少输入数量，边界值针对分区交界处的高缺陷密度。对 1～5 的整数，代表类可以是 3（有效）、0（无效），边界再补 1、2、4、5、6；如果只测 3 和 5，可能漏掉下界和上界外的解析错误。先确认闭开区间和单位，才能定义相邻值。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]